{{!
    @template theme_richimath/local/site_level_courses

    The courses of one level, grouped by the subcategory they sit in. Shared
    by the Levels menu of the site bar and the planets of the hero.

    Read-only on purpose: the public site shows what the academy teaches, it
    is not a way into a course. Course names are plain text, not links.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * empty - true when the level has no visible course yet
    * groups - label (subcategory path, may be empty) and courses (name)

    Example context (json):
    {
        "empty": false,
        "groups": [
            {"label": "PRE - CAYETANO", "courses": [{"name": "APTITUD MATEMÁTICA"}, {"name": "MATEMÁTICA"}]}
        ]
    }
}}
{{#empty}}
    <p class="rm-level-soon">
        <span class="rm-level-soon-chip">{{#str}} levelsoon, theme_richimath {{/str}}</span>
        {{#str}} levelsoontext, theme_richimath {{/str}}
    </p>
{{/empty}}
{{^empty}}
    <div class="rm-level-groups">
        {{#groups}}
            <section class="rm-level-group">
                {{#label}}<h4 class="rm-level-group-label">{{{ label }}}</h4>{{/label}}
                <ul class="rm-level-courses list-unstyled">
                    {{#courses}}
                        <li>{{{ name }}}</li>
                    {{/courses}}
                </ul>
            </section>
        {{/groups}}
    </div>
{{/empty}}
